     SPACELIKE w (frame-free scalar's gradient):
        fractional cone tilt (c_light - c_grav)/c = -B/(2*A)
        shift in Phi matter feels                  = 0
        shift in Psi matter feels                  = -B/(2*A)
     TIMELIKE w (khronon normal, LEDGER sf27's chassis):
        fractional cone tilt (c_light - c_grav)/c = -B/(2*A)
        shift in Phi matter feels                  = -B/(2*A)
        shift in Psi matter feels                  = 0
