      measured speed.  What the footings change is which points are deep-MOND: 2059 canonical vs 2133 alt of 2786.
      LOCAL_NO_GO section 3.2 quotes Phi_MOND = v_flat^2/c^2 = 3.9e-7 (NGC 4993's host), 3.0e-7 (Milky Way);
